'''Cane''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2021 Christmas Box|Christmas Box]] during the [[Christmas Event 2021|2021 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended. 

==Appearance ==
The entire blade of the knife is surrounded with a golden outline with a red and white candy cane design in the middle. The guard is also golden like the blade outline and the handle is solid black with a golden pommel.

== Trivia ==
*It has a [[Cane Gun (2021)|partner gun]] under the same name.

